[4.113342, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m# Both waves correlated to workgroup (0,0,0) at positions /0 and /1, each reading its own private 'local' (3 and 451) — a real multi-wave kernel, no AMD GPU required.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
